# Neither MOVE nor UIDPLUS: bud must not move anything. Hand-written
S: * OK IMAP4 service ready
C: a1 CAPABILITY
S: * CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1
S: a1 OK CAPABILITY completed
C: a2 LOGIN "someone@example.com" "app-pass"
S: a2 OK user logged in
C: a3 SELECT "INBOX"
S: * 3 EXISTS
S: a3 OK [READ-WRITE] SELECT completed
C: a4 CAPABILITY
S: * CAPABILITY IMAP4rev1
S: a4 OK CAPABILITY completed
C: a5 LOGOUT
S: * BYE logging out
S: a5 OK LOGOUT completed
